<div class="opening">
  <div class="label">JB MEDIA — The Frequency</div>
  <div class="opening-border">
    <p class="headline-small">Some describe the room. We build it.</p>
    <p class="headline-large">Since 1992, we have been inside the moments that define culture — before they are moments, before they have names.<br><br>Where the street finds the atelier. Where the underground and the legacy recognise each other. We perceive the frequency before it has a name — and then we build the rooms for it to thrive.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="since">This is our vocation since 1992</p>
</div>

