<div class="node" id="n1992a" onclick="open_panel(this,'1992','The Founding','The conviction before the market.','1992. Milano. The most prestigious advertising market in the world — and the most turned inward. Luxury spoke only to itself. The same titles, the same pages, the same plans, season after season. Outside those rooms, the world was already changing fast — new cultures forming, new frequencies rising, new tribes emerging from the underground. The mainstream had yet to hear them.','JB MEDIA was founded on that conviction. We answered before the question arrived.')">
