<div class="node" id="n1997" onclick="open_panel(this,'1997','Quincy Jones','Some tables change everything.','1997. Milano. JB MEDIA hosted a soul food brunch and put Quincy Jones at the table with every major designer in the city — and Ligabue, and Jovanotti. People who had never shared a room, let alone a table. What happened inside stayed inside. What came out of it became history.','When Quincy Jones is at the table, the room becomes history.')">
