<div class="node" id="n1998" onclick="open_panel(this,'1998','NEST','The extraordinary has no address.','We brought NEST to Italy — Joe Holtzman\u2019s radical quarterly that collided the igloo with the palazzo, the prison cell with the couture atelier. While the industry genuflected at minimalism, Holtzman believed an igloo and a Park Avenue penthouse deserved equal attention. 26 issues. Collected today. Impossible to find.','The distinction between high and low was irrelevant. Only the exceptional mattered.')">
